  "title": {
   "en": "Game World Tensei (Dungeons Activity) ~Gamers play [Dungeon Job Hunting Recommendations] \u003cfrom the beginning\u003e ~"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "ゲーム世界転生〈ダン活〉～ゲーマーは【ダンジョン就活のススメ】を〈はじめから〉プレイする～@COMIC"
   },
   {
    "en": "Game Addict Plays \"Encouragement for Job Hunting in Dungeons\" from a \"New Game\""
   },
   {
    "ja-ro": "Game Sekai Tensei 〈Dan Katsu〉~ Game wa [Dungeon Shūkatsu no Susume] o 〈Hajime Kara〉 Play suru ~ @COMIC"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "A legendary god-tier game, *\"Dungeon Job Hunting Recommendation\"*, aka *\"DanKatsu\"*, features an unprecedented 1,021 playable job classes and over 400 different endings! The more you play, the stronger you become, unlocking new abilities and rare items.  \n\nOne dedicated gamer (PN: Zephyrus) finds himself reincarnated as the protagonist of this very game! Overjoyed at the chance to experience it in real life, he immediately enrolls in the labyrinth academy—the game's main stage. Armed with his extensive knowledge of the game’s mechanics, he aims to obtain the ultimate class: **Hero**.  \n\nNot only that, but he also guides his timid childhood friend toward the **Alchemist** class, allowing the two of them to breeze through the academy’s curriculum and rapidly level up! Powerful jobs, legendary loot, and epic rewards—secured at lightning speed!",
   "ja": "プレイ可能職が前代未聞の1021職、そのエンディング数・400以上！\nやり込むほど新たな強さとアイテムを手にできる伝説の神ゲー〈ダンジョン就活のススメ〉、通称〈ダン活〉。\n\nとあるゲーマー（PN：ゼフィルス）が転生したのは、その主人公だった――。リアルで遊べることに狂喜しつつ早速メインステージとなる迷宮学園へ入学した彼は、極めつくした攻略情報をもとに王道の最強職【勇者】を得ることに。さらには弱気な幼馴染の少女を【錬金術師】へと導き、2人で効率良く学園のカリキュラムをこなし、高速でレベルを上げる！強ジョブ・お宝・超ゲット！"
  },
